	(text "Aiming for 680-700uF total capacitance\nfor around 50Hz cut-off.\n\nNote that it does not mean low frequencies\nwill be perceived significantly lower.\nThe damping factor below the cut-off is\nsignificantly reduced, which would create\nmore low end “bloom”, and more perceivable\ndeepness.\n\nMore caps are better to distribute current\n(make sure ESR is consistent so some caps\nare not overworking over others).\nThis way you would not need big current\nripple rating for the caps.\nSo you can use smaller values but put\na big grid of them, so the current is\ndistributed between all of them."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 182.626 62.992 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "02dded4d-757c-43cb-b89a-1543ec3260e8")
	)
